  "description": "The pirate Ian, renowned throughout the land for his strength and beauty, has been captured?! But contrary to the king's order to capture him alive, no trace of the pirate could be found anywhere. Even Navy Captain Mikhail, the sole witness who claimed to have seen him and drowned at sea, was held responsible for failing to capture Ian and went into hiding... \n\nRumors spread that in the dark corner of a room somewhere within the Navy's villa, someone's moans could be heard every night...!\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
